f Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. October to November is the driest pair and came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025, September to October came in at 21% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 31% and May to June at 186% on the middle.</p>"}
